  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/probe/A1_NoduleInRightUpperLobe">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>PROBE A1 [EXPECT SUBCLASS of an existing class - yellow row in SubClass Of, moves in the tree when the dropdown is set to Inferred]: a nodule in the right upper lobe</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Deliberate test case, not part of the vocabulary. The differentia for PulmonaryNodule is scope to lung. The right upper lobe reaches lung by two partOf steps, so this fires only if the property chain scopedToRegion o partOf is working. This is decision-register item 3 made testable. If this probe does not do what its label says, a constraint has been lost or added. Only inconsistency shows as colour, so a probe expecting EQUIVALENT or SUBCLASS fails silently: check the Description panel, where the reasoner's conclusions appear as yellow rows, rather than looking for a colour in the tree.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="Ncc1bc7b98652412b80bb4f822cd9e7ea"/>
    <cde:designNote>[Group A] expect: subsumed by PulmonaryNodule. The differentia for PulmonaryNodule is scope to lung. The right upper lobe reaches lung by two partOf steps, so this fires only if the property chain scopedToRegion o partOf is working. This is decision-register item 3 made testable.</cde:designNote>
  </rdf:Description>
